# colrname: a click on a name makes it the window's background (a mutable color) and o writes that color's value; three names
# (cyan, cadet blue, navy: rows 13 pixels, the columns as the program lays them out on rgb.txt of gdata), then q quits
move 900 700
wait
click 1 420 32
wait
key o
wait
click 1 320 436
wait
key o
wait
click 1 800 20
wait
key o
wait
key q
